[{:db/id "q-130104/selection/7e1238e673ea73a96100e31e6de2b21f64ceb4dbde7edec0a7d4e45387fd7315" :answer/id #uuid "de25d71b-bea4-5750-a49c-b9bf16727cf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104/selection/30cc1901e28e02f87dffacc9cd0011641c86462d4e7ac2f26101b035f5793d39" :answer/id #uuid "ceea421c-4915-5c85-9f0b-c65ea38fe9bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,4⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104/selection/b59b440ff9f2955244bcb45fa49ef2e844db03291f62f5cf4e0f8bcf289cc6cb" :answer/id #uuid "d7818237-311d-56e4-831f-ba844891720a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,-6⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104/selection/15340357bf96c7456dcd82829f656df8bad9eebf316344adb0abdf7e4f5de3d3" :answer/id #uuid "b7f1da5f-3838-5a70-81f0-c9ffb01370b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,1⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104/selection/fe554eb76813b8ac10cd9a75d1f9117a72b2760e98f723f83cc10e9456db3dea" :answer/id #uuid "f97a590d-fce5-5e33-bb2e-45de846df8e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a523664d-f597-5f0d-bd78-2f5447ba6f3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130104/selection/b59b440ff9f2955244bcb45fa49ef2e844db03291f62f5cf4e0f8bcf289cc6cb" :answer-field/choices ["q-130104/selection/7e1238e673ea73a96100e31e6de2b21f64ceb4dbde7edec0a7d4e45387fd7315" "q-130104/selection/30cc1901e28e02f87dffacc9cd0011641c86462d4e7ac2f26101b035f5793d39" "q-130104/selection/b59b440ff9f2955244bcb45fa49ef2e844db03291f62f5cf4e0f8bcf289cc6cb" "q-130104/selection/15340357bf96c7456dcd82829f656df8bad9eebf316344adb0abdf7e4f5de3d3" "q-130104/selection/fe554eb76813b8ac10cd9a75d1f9117a72b2760e98f723f83cc10e9456db3dea"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130104" :question/id #uuid "f2c57511-2e36-5133-bef3-7c7abf9f86dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-130104" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x,y)={x}^{2}-4xy+5{y}^{2}$ find the equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point where $(x,y)=(-1,-1).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the tangent line to the level curve $f(x,y)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y)$ and evaluate it at $(x,y)=(-1,-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}-4xy+5{y}^{2})\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}-4xy+5{y}^{2})\\,j \\\\  & =(2x-4y)\\,i+(10y-4x)\\,j \\\\ ∇f(-1,-1) & =(2(-1)-4(-1))\\,i+(10(-1)-4(-1))\\,j \\\\  & =2\\,i-6\\,j \\\\  & =⟨2,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(-1,-1)\\cdot ⟨x-(-1),\\,y-(-1)⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨2,-6⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y+1⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130104/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5ae7e9c8-60e9-5f5e-afbf-1de6bb01bf07"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130104"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection/e6edc724cd8b4ab811a04700cc1d1285ce5a542bb7350d882eeb82d40fd1b88c" :answer/id #uuid "e1dc6ab9-cfb6-5369-8e57-51391b3bb68e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5,5⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection/2be9e4de79c4e8ea7283911bdb1884c989ebba5857c1e548b87827dc1ce77957" :answer/id #uuid "bb86f54d-3dfc-5df7-acc6-5c7099191532" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-5,5⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection/e2c2d0ace7ea35a75343b1166dddbd38a8580a2c9df1eaa2ad64f18065efa20c" :answer/id #uuid "84e85b34-e2ca-50b0-b18f-081553e7f467" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,3⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection/0ead24f10ba18a4295713a01666d160c269f984e9e2772f38c73b8abd9a47ddd" :answer/id #uuid "0b19fa08-b3d4-58bf-8b6a-6d0a921a167c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,2⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection/247c0f4580432f46efbc2fd2711542b567ce4790f7e8235cabe4d4f8e05d53df" :answer/id #uuid "5bb58c24-f9de-5884-864d-bda87a6da32b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,5⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1dd633ae-c063-5e27-a4cc-b4f697474c1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72377/selection/e6edc724cd8b4ab811a04700cc1d1285ce5a542bb7350d882eeb82d40fd1b88c" :answer-field/choices ["q-72377/selection/e6edc724cd8b4ab811a04700cc1d1285ce5a542bb7350d882eeb82d40fd1b88c" "q-72377/selection/2be9e4de79c4e8ea7283911bdb1884c989ebba5857c1e548b87827dc1ce77957" "q-72377/selection/e2c2d0ace7ea35a75343b1166dddbd38a8580a2c9df1eaa2ad64f18065efa20c" "q-72377/selection/0ead24f10ba18a4295713a01666d160c269f984e9e2772f38c73b8abd9a47ddd" "q-72377/selection/247c0f4580432f46efbc2fd2711542b567ce4790f7e8235cabe4d4f8e05d53df"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72377" :question/id #uuid "85c3a288-e595-578f-a534-db75ed9d872f" :question/math-academy-id "q-72377" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x,y)=2x{y}^{2}+xy+2x$, find the equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point where $(x,y)=(1,1).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the tangent line to the level curve $f(x,y)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y)$ and evaluate it at $(x,y)=(1,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2x{y}^{2}+xy+2x)\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x{y}^{2}+xy+2x)\\,j \\\\  & =(2{y}^{2}+y+2)\\,i+(4xy+x)\\,j \\\\ ∇\\,f(1,1) & =(2(1)^{2}+(1)+2)\\,i+(4(1)(1)+(1))\\,j \\\\  & =5\\,i+5\\,j \\\\  & =⟨5,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(1,1)\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨5,5⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-1⟩ & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72377/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5ae7e9c8-60e9-5f5e-afbf-1de6bb01bf07"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72377"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection/f2212b6f6e503df386ea2b85c74ba2e3110368c0f2a1df970be5880693f0d7f7" :answer/id #uuid "c95e90dd-ff7e-5c00-8eaa-c5f4fbf695c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection/c8ff41dc5f1598458bbcbba39a57064b8516969be9d407578163413a62f5e31c" :answer/id #uuid "4a9e1555-81a1-564b-9ea0-5488bed4dbfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection/6e801c58417c5ad9e79804a4fc54219f626aed8def840156f5b61cf23ec11249" :answer/id #uuid "72f2a4bb-cebc-55e1-9a75-437026044a5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,1⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection/f2c636ef1cb337b688664d874bf9fe04e462cebb3c857595a98a82fe25e28384" :answer/id #uuid "53224f6b-4759-5f49-acea-12618709253d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection/e58eb92263aafeb73c0e814e9eaf075e1d4b0ea1753f346610346dc4036a7a0c" :answer/id #uuid "0042bac8-ca7d-5d14-ad6a-ce18448d845d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f51af24-b51a-5d2e-abb6-cb06cae2df23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130096/selection/c8ff41dc5f1598458bbcbba39a57064b8516969be9d407578163413a62f5e31c" :answer-field/choices ["q-130096/selection/f2212b6f6e503df386ea2b85c74ba2e3110368c0f2a1df970be5880693f0d7f7" "q-130096/selection/c8ff41dc5f1598458bbcbba39a57064b8516969be9d407578163413a62f5e31c" "q-130096/selection/6e801c58417c5ad9e79804a4fc54219f626aed8def840156f5b61cf23ec11249" "q-130096/selection/f2c636ef1cb337b688664d874bf9fe04e462cebb3c857595a98a82fe25e28384" "q-130096/selection/e58eb92263aafeb73c0e814e9eaf075e1d4b0ea1753f346610346dc4036a7a0c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130096" :question/id #uuid "16e9a270-9782-5652-91b5-39a42de0d9ec" :question/math-academy-id "q-130096" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1),$ find the equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point where $(x,y)=(-1,0).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the tangent line to the level curve $f(x,y)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y)$ and evaluate it at $(x,y)=(-1,0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1))\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1))\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1}\\,i+\\frac{2y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1}\\,j \\\\ ∇f(-1,0) & =\\frac{2(-1)}{(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}+1}\\,i+\\frac{2(0)}{(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}+1}\\,j \\\\  & =(-1)i+0\\,j \\\\  & =⟨-1,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(-1,0)\\cdot ⟨x-(-1),\\,y-0⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨-1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130096/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5ae7e9c8-60e9-5f5e-afbf-1de6bb01bf07"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130096"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection/55aa8c38451b0a39bae54553cc1ebd8aeb43a065d1645a7a971258aead07c919" :answer/id #uuid "0a4e6769-3b61-54d8-a0ad-32e98aac3d93" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection/1f12ff831d01add16752ed904edec0cabb405fde01df10c4351245a91e16c3ff" :answer/id #uuid "3392f2ea-7bd8-5a9c-8f75-bbcb4aee4fbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection/fa217c5809394f7bca1b1f1aebf93bf448f60bcc1db570c293e633aba0f6f34d" :answer/id #uuid "9583eddb-dae7-5dce-a4e5-debb3f397366" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection/2c871c84fe063f3f0d93201842c5120dd60a8fce90fa009915ca415dba38c612" :answer/id #uuid "3068cec5-12bd-57f2-a69f-39dd20c8e0d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection/a3962e60aac2763cc4a96aaf8e7e41ddac73aa97f849a30c92c2c04edd1a7b1c" :answer/id #uuid "8a33f154-b3e9-53b6-88bb-18be76a03611" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130094/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6dd51780-056a-